--- Logical Expression Chaining ---
r1:
true
r2:
false
r3:
false
--- Non-Boolean Truthiness in Conditionals ---
0 is falsy
100 is truthy
empty string is falsy
non-empty string is truthy
nil is falsy
empty array is truthy
empty dict is truthy
--- Logical Short-Circuit Value Returns ---
Short-circuit OR (true or side_effect):
OR passed
Short-circuit AND (false and side_effect):
AND short-circuited
